{"docstore/metadata": {"e1d43327-f26e-4b9f-ae84-a52ec8ad5535": {"doc_hash": "8774352b871b6fa447f07ae6fc66291c36c1665844b7ee400ddae06ea0adfba0"}, "f6615034-5427-42d1-b443-61f9f08d9472": {"doc_hash": "76ac5c6c5b7dde1e447890214a58adbe280f63f8732fd65bd383a63d060c71bb"}, "d5b6870a-71c6-4ba0-923c-dc19950b6d22": {"doc_hash": "81dfeac2f4a0e762dcce141b2b0018b1fdf8f778f4666be7ce36c5dba9a85178"}, "721deac4-0b70-418e-bced-5645dfe8fe09": {"doc_hash": "0604de16ee4a8309128cb701035d9c34f42e389c86972c3aab70d9f12d88ae98"}, "862d0477-b7e2-4d55-b1d3-36a824f52480": {"doc_hash": "6331cd83c414be7c8d417f8ae0c905a09749590002a135da1e820d3efc67a07f"}, "91b5f3f8-43b3-4c6e-a7cd-4e50ca61803c": {"doc_hash": "8774352b871b6fa447f07ae6fc66291c36c1665844b7ee400ddae06ea0adfba0", "ref_doc_id": "e1d43327-f26e-4b9f-ae84-a52ec8ad5535"}, "6391894f-92f6-47b4-b461-804d50f5802e": {"doc_hash": "76ac5c6c5b7dde1e447890214a58adbe280f63f8732fd65bd383a63d060c71bb", "ref_doc_id": "f6615034-5427-42d1-b443-61f9f08d9472"}, "e2d693c0-55fa-47bf-96f6-d60bb4b60fca": {"doc_hash": "81dfeac2f4a0e762dcce141b2b0018b1fdf8f778f4666be7ce36c5dba9a85178", "ref_doc_id": "d5b6870a-71c6-4ba0-923c-dc19950b6d22"}, "1d87c0e5-22cc-4c0a-96ed-9647bda14f59": {"doc_hash": "0604de16ee4a8309128cb701035d9c34f42e389c86972c3aab70d9f12d88ae98", "ref_doc_id": "721deac4-0b70-418e-bced-5645dfe8fe09"}, "8ed8f718-ea9c-4f01-a01d-5636224a22d8": {"doc_hash": "6331cd83c414be7c8d417f8ae0c905a09749590002a135da1e820d3efc67a07f", "ref_doc_id": "862d0477-b7e2-4d55-b1d3-36a824f52480"}}, "docstore/data": {"91b5f3f8-43b3-4c6e-a7cd-4e50ca61803c": {"__data__": {"id_": "91b5f3f8-43b3-4c6e-a7cd-4e50ca61803c", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "e1d43327-f26e-4b9f-ae84-a52ec8ad5535", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "hash": "8774352b871b6fa447f07ae6fc66291c36c1665844b7ee400ddae06ea0adfba0", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "Kategori: Manajemen Akun\nPertanyaan: Apa itu Akun INAPROC dan bagaimana sistem loginnya?\nJawaban: Akun INAPROC menggunakan sistem Single Sign-On (SSO). Pengguna hanya memerlukan satu akun untuk mengakses berbagai aplikasi di ekosistem Platform Pengadaan Nasional seperti Katalog v6, Pusat Bantuan, Daftar Hitam, dan Pusat Kendali.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 330, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "6391894f-92f6-47b4-b461-804d50f5802e": {"__data__": {"id_": "6391894f-92f6-47b4-b461-804d50f5802e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f6615034-5427-42d1-b443-61f9f08d9472", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "hash": "76ac5c6c5b7dde1e447890214a58adbe280f63f8732fd65bd383a63d060c71bb", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "Kategori: Manajemen Akun\nPertanyaan: Mengapa pendaftaran Akun INAPROC wajib menggunakan email pribadi dan bukan email instansi/perusahaan?\nJawaban: Karena satu akun SSO digunakan untuk berbagai peran. Jika menggunakan email instansi/perusahaan dan pengguna resign atau akses email dicabut, pengguna akan kehilangan akses ke akun tersebut, tidak bisa menerima OTP, dan kepemilikan akun jangka panjang akan terganggu.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 415, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "e2d693c0-55fa-47bf-96f6-d60bb4b60fca": {"__data__": {"id_": "e2d693c0-55fa-47bf-96f6-d60bb4b60fca", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d5b6870a-71c6-4ba0-923c-dc19950b6d22", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}, "hash": "81dfeac2f4a0e762dcce141b2b0018b1fdf8f778f4666be7ce36c5dba9a85178", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "Kategori: Manajemen Akun\nPertanyaan: Apakah Akun INAPROC yang sudah terdaftar bisa dinonaktifkan atau dihapus?\nJawaban: Kecuali terdapat indikasi tindakan kriminal, akun tidak dapat dinonaktifkan atas permintaan pribadi demi menjaga integritas data dan jejak aktivitas pengguna untuk kebutuhan audit atau investigasi masa depan.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 328, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "1d87c0e5-22cc-4c0a-96ed-9647bda14f59": {"__data__": {"id_": "1d87c0e5-22cc-4c0a-96ed-9647bda14f59", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/17265349600399", "category": "E-Katalog v6"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "721deac4-0b70-418e-bced-5645dfe8fe09", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/17265349600399", "category": "E-Katalog v6"}, "hash": "0604de16ee4a8309128cb701035d9c34f42e389c86972c3aab70d9f12d88ae98", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "Kategori: E-Katalog v6\nPertanyaan: Bagaimana skema KBLI yang berlaku pada Kategori Produk Katalog v6 saat ini?\nJawaban: Kategori Produk menggunakan skema Dual KBLI, yaitu gabungan antara KBLI 2020 dan KBLI 2025. Pembuatan paket Mini Kompetisi baru akan mengacu pada KBLI Kategori dan ketersediaan KBLI aktif Penyedia di Akun SIKAP.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 331, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "8ed8f718-ea9c-4f01-a01d-5636224a22d8": {"__data__": {"id_": "8ed8f718-ea9c-4f01-a01d-5636224a22d8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/requests/new", "category": "Pusat Bantuan"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "862d0477-b7e2-4d55-b1d3-36a824f52480", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/requests/new", "category": "Pusat Bantuan"}, "hash": "6331cd83c414be7c8d417f8ae0c905a09749590002a135da1e820d3efc67a07f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "Kategori: Pusat Bantuan\nPertanyaan: Apa saja syarat dan ketentuan saat mengirimkan tiket aduan atau kendala baru?\nJawaban: Pengguna wajib mengisi email, jenis layanan, deskripsi aduan, serta melampirkan screenshot/dokumen penuh (maksimal 7 MB per file). Pengguna juga harus menyetujui validitas data serta memberikan izin reset email/telepon untuk verifikasi tiket.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 365, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/ref_doc_info": {"e1d43327-f26e-4b9f-ae84-a52ec8ad5535": {"node_ids": ["91b5f3f8-43b3-4c6e-a7cd-4e50ca61803c"], "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}}, "f6615034-5427-42d1-b443-61f9f08d9472": {"node_ids": ["6391894f-92f6-47b4-b461-804d50f5802e"], "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}}, "d5b6870a-71c6-4ba0-923c-dc19950b6d22": {"node_ids": ["e2d693c0-55fa-47bf-96f6-d60bb4b60fca"], "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/13197123127311", "category": "Manajemen Akun"}}, "721deac4-0b70-418e-bced-5645dfe8fe09": {"node_ids": ["1d87c0e5-22cc-4c0a-96ed-9647bda14f59"], "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/articles/17265349600399", "category": "E-Katalog v6"}}, "862d0477-b7e2-4d55-b1d3-36a824f52480": {"node_ids": ["8ed8f718-ea9c-4f01-a01d-5636224a22d8"], "metadata": {"url": "https://bantuan.inaproc.id/hc/id-id/requests/new", "category": "Pusat Bantuan"}}}}